    "title": "Willis Knighton Physician Spotlight: Dr. Miriam Hankins - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Submitted article ,\n22 hours ago Miriam Estes Hankins, MD, MS, is a maternal-fetal medicine specialist at Regional Perinatal Group – Shreveport, 2508 Bert Kouns Industrial Loop, Suite 210. She cares for women with high-risk pregnancies and complex maternal or fetal conditions, including hypertension, diabetes and clotting disorders, as well as pregnancies complicated by fetal growth abnormalities, genetic conditions, birth defects and multiple gestations. Read full article\n2",
